+%% BEAM.com: the reload of new code from the file of a program
+%% (beam_com_reload). It starts only with -beam_com_reload MS of beam.com
+%% (else beam_com_reload:start_link/0 gives ignore). It is temporary: an
+%% error of it never stops the node.
